---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Resources"
description: "Free downloadable templates from Rhemroyal Services, including a business plan template and a 90-day goal and action worksheet."
navActive: resources
permalink: "resources.html"
---
<div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><span>/</span>Resources</div>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">RESOURCES</span>
    <h1>Practical templates to get you started.</h1>
    <p class="lede">A few free tools to help you make progress before, during or after working with us. More are added over time.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="resource-grid">
      {% for r in resources.resources %}
      <article class="resource-card">
        <div class="resource-type">{{ r.type }}</div>
        <h3>{{ r.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ r.description }}</p>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ r.file }}" download>{{ r.buttonLabel }}</a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
      <article class="resource-card">
        <div class="resource-type">TRAINING & WORKSHOPS</div>
        <h3>Coaching & Training Sessions</h3>
        <p>Looking for something more hands-on than a template? Our coaching and training service covers founder coaching, team workshops and leadership development.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/services.html#coaching-training">See coaching & training</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pale">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MORE TO READ</span><h2>From the blog.</h2><p>Short, practical articles on strategy, planning and organisational growth.</p></div>
    <a class="card-link" href="/blog.html">Browse all articles →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sm white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="newsletter">
      <div class="newsletter-copy">
        <h3>Get new templates and articles by email</h3>
        <p>Occasional insights on strategy, planning and organisational growth. No spam, unsubscribe any time.</p>
      </div>
      <form class="newsletter-form" data-remote-form="newsletterFormEndpoint" data-success-message="Thanks for subscribing — look out for our next update.">
        <label class="sr-only" for="newsletter-email-resources">Email address</label>
        <input type="email" id="newsletter-email-resources" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-orange">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <p class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
</section>
